---
Print the second-to-last directory visited in this session

Usage: furet back [OPTIONS] --session <SESSION>

Options:
      --session <SESSION>  Terminal session to look the previous directory up in
      --steps <STEPS>      How many directories back to go; 1 is the previous directory [default: 1]
  -h, --help               Print help
